{"status":"answered","model_status":"answered","answer":"澳大利亚校区：注册 DSS 需要填写注册表，并由健康专业人员（A部分）以及学生本人（B、C部分）完成、签名并注明日期。可以随时注册，但最好在课程开始前完成，以便及时安排支持。","points":[{"text":"注册表的A部分必须由健康专业人员填写，亲戚或家人朋友不能代填。","source_id":"au-disability-register#3","quote":"Part A can’t be completed by a relative or family friend.","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"How to register","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"可以提交注册表的电子版或PDF版本；可将电子版先发给健康专业人员填写A部分，再由其寄回给你填写B、C部分。","source_id":"au-disability-register#3","quote":"Send a digital copy of the registration form to your health professional to complete.","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"How to register","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"如果你已有健康专业人员出具的支持文件，无需填写A部分，只需向DSS发邮件，附上支持文件和签名并注明日期的C部分。","source_id":"au-disability-register#6","quote":"you don’t need to complete Part A of the registration form – just send an email to DSS with:","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"Already have supporting documents?","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"如需替代评估安排，必须先在DSS注册，且越早注册越好，因为评估需要一定时间（适用于所有校区）。","source_id":"all-disability-alternative-assessment#2","quote":"To be eligible for alternative arrangements, you need to register with Disability Support Services (DSS).","doc":"all-disability-alternative-assessment","title":"Alternative assessment arrangements","section":"Eligibility","level":null,"campus":"all","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/admin/assessments/alternative","verified":true,"reason":null}],"citations":[{"source_id":"au-disability-register#3","quote":"The registration form needs to be completed, signed and dated by both a health professional (Part A) and the student seeking registration (Part B and Part C).","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"How to register","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null},{"source_id":"au-disability-overview#3","quote":"To get started, fill in our registration form and arrange to meet with us.","doc":"au-disability-overview","title":"Disability Support Services","section":"Register for assistance","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability","verified":true,"reason":null}],"criteria":[{"id":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register"},{"id":"au-disability-overview","title":"Disability Support Services","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability"},{"id":"all-disability-alternative-assessment","title":"Alternative assessment arrangements","level":null,"campus":"all","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/admin/assessments/alternative"}],"missing_info":"这些段落只适用于澳大利亚校区，没有说明马来西亚或印尼校区的注册步骤。段落也没有提供注册表的获取链接、DSS的联系方式或办公地点，也没有说明三个注册步骤的具体内容。","clarifying_question":"","checks":{"quotes_total":6,"quotes_verified":6,"withheld":false},"trace":{"method":"vector + rerank","campus":"au","query":"How do I register with Disability Support Services (DSS)?","translated_from":"怎么注册 DSS（残障支持服务）？","candidates":20,"ms":{"translate":0,"retrieve":4,"rerank":1023},"chunks":[{"id":"au-disability-register#3","doc":"au-disability-register",